{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19158","headline":"和乐天南园试小乐 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天南园试小乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲步南园烟雨晴，遥闻丝竹出墙声。\n欲抛丹笔三川去，先教清商一部成。\n花木手栽偏有兴，歌词自作别生情。\n多才遇景皆能咏，当日人传满凤城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}